<td style="padding:0 20px 0 20px;text-align:left;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:16px;color:#000000;max-width:100%"><p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:24px;"><span style="color:#b70000;font-weight:bold;font-family:sans-serif;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">— The House will vote on the farm bill this week,</strong></span> and the Supreme Court will hear arguments on a contentious pesticide labeling case.</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:24px;"><span style="color:#b70000;font-weight:bold;font-family:sans-serif;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">— A USDA union invoked its right to bargain</strong></span> over the closure of day cares located in department buildings.</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:24px;"><span style="color:#b70000;font-weight:bold;font-family:sans-serif;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">— A new Capitol area ad buy</strong></span> advocates blocking Proposition 12 through federal legislation.</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:24px;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">IT’S MONDAY, APRIL 27. </strong>Welcome to Morning Agriculture! I’m your host, Rachel Shin. Send tips and pitches to <a href="mailto:rshin@politico.com" target="_blank">rshin@politico.com</a> and follow us at <a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.zmXQYxftKFWCpJXVm9O1dq0gTKvuJ2pZdjuXKPbdeYU/4q5/NlalU5gmRhW8spN89i56Xw/h2/h001.-ef2y3SWKRfdBxUh1UDBNKEDp-dzRZYZk0cFHZwuAXk" target="_blank">@Morning_Ag</a> for more.</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:24px;line-height:24px;"><i>Want to receive this newsletter every weekday? </i><a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.6g0Zd3AyneOViJYBXgbV635CG4SUqjbQNBk4U85WBteyczt3-laL1mFiy_etYzgK2G-DeciaiAgbv95Vf1Baakhl7FXc7iyukCzseOLGVGtFv3Mk8v9JwcpQR2SbGM_U/4q5/NlalU5gmRhW8spN89i56Xw/h3/h001.bi56YhFaAKXvMjqUpoA9b84wOoAZ25y--aZw489oC8s" target="_blank"><i>Subscribe to POLITICO Pro</i></a><i>. You’ll also receive daily policy news and other intelligence you need to act on the day’s biggest stories.</i><br/></p></td>
