<p style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:10px;color:#000000;">A message from Bayer:</p>
<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:24px;color:#000000;"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">86% of Americans think science misinformation is getting worse</strong> according to new data from a survey conducted by The Harris Poll on behalf of Bayer. When that misinformation targets modern farming practices, the fallout is real. Farmers face regulatory uncertainty while consumers grow more anxious about food safety. Still, a bipartisan majority of Americans agree; rigorous, evidence-based science is necessary for the country’s future. <a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.dgGKIUEMNqic94f5rSpPKCJCpfzLXKLU6KDtDs6qCfZLYYkmZS3PoJXUp0JefYNgakM4lZPV-V6vuQ2X7YncX-TUbg9EW5w9aq16eaD2V_E0nG__ITMSAdnzH7fFTAyTc0aRs-RdZZ6EN9zgljfwt1gj4xQM8H0ZPBkFU-u3cIYro_Wy7byjWFA4HXpbE_E2/4q5/NlalU5gmRhW8spN89i56Xw/h16/h001.GXtOFf7-1XCxoMUTHL56w5d7JIwW9Yk3TE07uec6GhY" style="text-decoration:underline;color:#007BC7;" target="_blank"><strong style="font-family:Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:bold;">Dig into the numbers.</strong></a></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="max-width:100%">
<td height="20" style="height:20px; font-size:0; border-top:1px solid #E5E7EB;max-width:100%"> </td>
