<p style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:15px;line-height:15px;"><a href="https://url4027.email.politico.com/ss/c/u001.dgGKIUEMNqic94f5rSpPKCJCpfzLXKLU6KDtDs6qCfZLYYkmZS3PoJXUp0JefYNgwOZgBvhubTJoS92pOYG-lEfU266ing0aQzf5bMFV4jVGVS8xSaUG-ZhnQmz8qhIMzYrJuS5C9TOfK-h77umiHL19eXfe_iSz93WtWBA-faZMjqrlGp8KnkV2gtEknaDJ/4q5/NlalU5gmRhW8spN89i56Xw/h21/h001.TwFs4TSDbPHDFlV3jcFqKieHj9rNzMqRIQeiYGQtIqY" target="_blank"><img alt="Advertisement Image" border="0" src="https://www.politico.com/dims4/default/d1abe54/2147483647/resize/1000x/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fstatic.politico.com%2F92%2F81%2Fefcd3e454fd08d1cae575a494b31%2Fbayer-sd-harris-poll-500x500-031626.jpg" style="width:100%;max-width:500px;max-width:100%;height:auto" title="Advertisement Image"/></a> <img a="" border="0" src="https://ad.doubleclick.net/ddm/ad/N7384.146504POLITICO0/B35757822.445306006;sz=1x1;ord=[timestamp]" style="max-width:100%;height:auto"/></p>
